flowchart TD
  A[Campaign Draft] --> B[Audience Definition]
  B --> C[Freeze Audience Snapshot]
  C --> D[Eligibility and Consent Check]
  D --> E[Suppression and Bounce Filter]
  E --> F[AI Personalization Drafts]
  F --> G[Content and Policy Validation]
  G --> H[Human Approval]
  H --> I{Approved exact version?}
  I -->|No| J[Reject / revise / cancel]
  I -->|Yes| K[Rate-limited Celery queue]
  K --> L[SMTP send with idempotency]
  L --> M[Store provider acceptance]
  M --> N[Process delivery/bounce/complaint/unsubscribe events]
  N --> O[Campaign analytics]
